<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3511/16  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5634/44  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.7533/43  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.3233/43  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     32.21/25   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.2825/55  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1534.8/5.8 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     113.13/23  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.7980/50  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5182/19  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     5.9830/50  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4027/37  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7990/95  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7325/35  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6383/93</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$370.90/371.40</p>
</text>
